/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_DspCore DspCore
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief Lookup tables, interpolation, generators, filters and transforms.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | Portable signal processing without MIDI or music-theory concepts |
 * | Active baseline | `v0.0.1` (coordinated release pending) |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/DspCore](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/DspCore) |
 * | Runtime dependencies | Foundation `0.0.1` or a newer 0.x release |
 * | Public CMake target | `DspCore::DspCore` |
 *
 * DspCore owns signal-processing concepts separately from MIDI and music theory.
 * It consumes pinned RoModularBuild `v0.6.2`, as do the other runtime libraries.
 * DspCore's 0.0.1 baseline provides lookup tables, interpolation, generators,
 * filters, block and streaming analysis, and configured DFT/FFT transforms.
 * MIDILAR pins DspCore `0.0.1` or a newer 0.x release. Arduino source builds support stock
 * C++11; CMake packages and direct-source integrations use C++17.
 */
